{
  "name": "Slayer's Strikes",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following Cunning Strike options.</p><ul><li><strong>Terrify (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw, or it has the Frightened condition for 1 minute. The Frightened target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</li><li><strong>Torment (Cost: 3d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or it becomes crippled with pain until the start of your next turn. For the duration, its Speed is halved and it has Disadvantage on Ability Checks, Attack Rolls, and Constitution Saving Throws to maintain concentration.</li></ul>",
